    "climbable": null,
    "drive_up": null,
    "trail_note": "Drive from Omak on Highway 155, then Omak Lookout Road. A high-clearance all-wheel-drive vehicle can reach the summit, but the road is very rocky about 2.5 miles from the top. The tower is a working, staffed lookout."
  },
